Read PRD.md before any task; it is the single source of truth. Follow CLAUDE.md hard rules, developer scopes (Dev A backend: db/, src/server/, src/app/api/, src/lib/contracts/; Dev B frontend: src/app/(portal)/, src/components/, src/hooks/, src/mocks/), and the working pattern (contract → server → route → UI → test). Enforce auth/role/ownership on the server, never send answer keys to candidates, no paid APIs, no numeric cheating scores, never commit .env files.
